WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.875
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:07.145 --> 00:09.025
‎SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

3
01:35.265 --> 01:39.025
‎ADAPTED FROM ‎JIA JIN CHAI‎, ORIGINAL NOVEL ‎BY XIAOJIAREN ON JINJIANG LITERATURE CITY

4
01:57.225 --> 01:58.065
Your injury…

5
02:00.065 --> 02:01.185
I leave everything else to you.

6
02:01.265 --> 02:02.865
Rest assured, My Lord.

7
02:02.945 --> 02:04.465
I will take good care of Madam.

8
02:12.145 --> 02:13.665
Bath water will be ready shortly.

9
02:13.745 --> 02:16.225
Please have some ginger soup to ward off the cold first, Madam.

10
02:19.585 --> 02:21.025
Bitao was also frightened.

11
02:21.105 --> 02:22.065
I wonder if she was hurt.

12
02:22.145 --> 02:23.625
I know.

13
02:23.705 --> 02:26.225
I had her check the wounds, bathe, and change her clothes.

14
02:26.305 --> 02:27.985
Once she gets cleaned up,

15
02:28.065 --> 02:29.905
I will have her come see you.

16
02:34.585 --> 02:37.265
My Lord has important matters to attend to tonight?

17
02:39.025 --> 02:40.105
Well…

18
02:41.145 --> 02:42.745
I shouldn't have pried.

19
02:46.625 --> 02:47.665
How is she?

20
02:48.345 --> 02:49.185
Let's talk business.

21
02:49.265 --> 02:50.145
HERITAGE PRESERVED, GOODNESS PROCLAIMED

22
02:50.225 --> 02:51.065
Just as you expected,

23
02:51.745 --> 02:53.425
sending assassins was merely a distraction

24
02:53.505 --> 02:55.185
meant to stall us on purpose.

25
02:55.265 --> 02:57.425
Those assassins were hired with heavy bribes

26
02:57.505 --> 02:58.905
through multiple intermediaries,

27
03:00.145 --> 03:01.905
and none of them know who is behind it.

28
03:05.465 --> 03:06.585
My Lord,

29
03:06.665 --> 03:08.585
Zhuang Qi, the servant responsible for sweeping Songyue Hall tonight,

30
03:08.665 --> 03:10.665
took advantage of the absence of the master and attendants

31
03:10.745 --> 03:11.865
to sneak into the study to steal.

32
03:12.665 --> 03:15.665
The study was left unguarded, allowing him to snatch the secret letter.

33
03:15.745 --> 03:17.585
He is now heading toward Guangji Street.

34
03:19.265 --> 03:23.105
This is a good chance to see who the master of this rat really is.

35
03:25.505 --> 03:28.585
MARQUIS OF XITING'S RESIDENCE

36
03:31.305 --> 03:34.625
HAN LIAO, HEIR TO THE MARQUIS OF XITING

37
03:34.705 --> 03:37.865
Sir. Please take a look, sir.

38
03:38.625 --> 03:40.905
Lu Zhuo was cautious. The secret letter was hidden under the floor tile.

39
03:40.985 --> 03:43.105
I managed to steal it while he was off guard

40
03:43.185 --> 03:45.105
and rushed to present it to you.

41
03:45.865 --> 03:48.585
I planted you as a pawn six years ago,

42
03:48.665 --> 03:51.665
yet you couldn't even enter Songyue Hall's Study.

43
03:56.265 --> 03:58.785
Today you finally proved useful.

44
03:59.385 --> 04:00.905
Yes, sir.

45
04:12.505 --> 04:13.785
See for yourself what this is.

46
04:19.624 --> 04:20.985
"Traitorous servant, you are fed by your lord,

47
04:21.064 --> 04:23.105
-so you should be loyal to him." -He…

48
04:23.185 --> 04:25.985
"How could you collude with foreigners and invite disaster?"

49
04:26.065 --> 04:28.265
"Your treachery is unforgivable."

50
04:28.345 --> 04:29.945
"Wash your neck,

51
04:30.025 --> 04:31.945
for I shall take your wretched head."

52
04:32.025 --> 04:32.985
Sir.

53
04:34.625 --> 04:35.825
Spare my life, sir.

54
04:35.905 --> 04:38.505
Sir, I… I didn't know that inside…

55
04:38.585 --> 04:40.025
-This is… -Sir,

56
04:40.105 --> 04:41.265
Lu Zhuo led a crowd and surrounded the main gate.

57
04:42.225 --> 04:43.265
Lu Zhuo?

58
04:44.305 --> 04:46.345
Sir. Spare my life, sir.

59
04:46.425 --> 04:48.945
-I knew nothing… -Fool!

60
04:49.545 --> 04:51.065
We fell into his trap.

61
05:06.465 --> 05:08.225
It is already past midnight.

62
05:08.865 --> 05:11.025
May I ask what brings you here

63
05:11.625 --> 05:12.745
at such an hour, Lord Lu?

64
05:13.345 --> 05:15.705
Pardon my intrusion, Lord Han.

65
05:16.305 --> 05:19.185
A servant in my residence stole a treasure and fled.

66
05:19.785 --> 05:22.105
Many witnesses saw him escape into your manor.

67
05:22.185 --> 05:24.585
Please accommodate me

68
05:25.105 --> 05:27.505
and allow me to catch this audacious thief.

69
05:29.545 --> 05:32.225
Lord Lu, you are making it clear

70
05:32.305 --> 05:34.385
that you want to search my residence.

71
05:37.145 --> 05:39.145
What if I insist on refusing?

72
05:39.905 --> 05:42.705
The stolen item is a jade-hilted dagger bestowed by the late Emperor.

73
05:43.345 --> 05:45.465
The thief is guilty of high treason.

74
05:46.105 --> 05:48.585
Harboring him will be punished as equal treason.

75
05:49.625 --> 05:51.145
Lord Han, you have always been prudent.

76
05:51.785 --> 05:53.225
You wouldn't be so foolish, would you?

77
05:59.625 --> 06:02.585
Lord Lu, this way, please.

78
06:15.785 --> 06:17.385
What is happening?

79
06:17.465 --> 06:18.785
Pull them apart quickly.

80
06:44.145 --> 06:45.665
NO ANIMALS WERE HARMED DURING FILMING

81
06:45.745 --> 06:46.785
FILMED UNDER PROFESSIONAL SUPERVISION WITHOUT HARM

82
06:52.425 --> 06:54.185
Could this be the thief

83
06:54.265 --> 06:55.745
you were looking for, Lord Lu?

84
06:56.505 --> 07:00.025
I keep about twenty fierce hounds in this manor.

85
07:00.745 --> 07:02.265
Unluckily for this blind thief,

86
07:02.345 --> 07:04.985
he barged right in and became their midnight meal.

87
07:06.025 --> 07:08.145
I'm afraid you came for nothing, Lord Lu.

88
07:09.785 --> 07:11.425
Come help

89
07:12.025 --> 07:15.265
check if this thief has any valuables on him.

90
07:16.305 --> 07:17.385
Zhao Song.

91
07:35.905 --> 07:37.785
Lord Han, what fine dogs you've raised.

92
07:37.865 --> 07:40.105
Not a single survivor was left.

93
07:40.185 --> 07:42.825
My hounds have always fed on raw meat.

94
07:42.905 --> 07:46.385
Their ferocity is no less than that of wild wolves.

95
07:48.105 --> 07:52.585
Why don't I send extra men to help you thoroughly search along the way

96
07:53.265 --> 07:55.465
to see where he'd drop the treasure?

97
07:56.065 --> 07:57.585
It couldn't have vanished into thin air, right?

98
08:00.025 --> 08:02.705
It is getting late. No need to trouble yourself, Lord Han.

99
08:03.585 --> 08:04.705
I shall handle it myself.

100
08:09.865 --> 08:11.065
Until we meet again.

101
08:14.745 --> 08:15.585
Let's go.

102
08:20.185 --> 08:21.625
Take good care, Lord Lu.

103
08:22.145 --> 08:24.185
Forgive me for not seeing you off.

104
08:25.905 --> 08:27.105
Thanks to your clever scheme, Master,

105
08:27.185 --> 08:28.665
that Lu guy

106
08:28.745 --> 08:31.065
-found no witnesses. -Peak stupidity!

107
08:32.105 --> 08:33.505
Since he's certain it was me,

108
08:34.144 --> 08:36.225
this deadly feud is already sealed.

109
08:36.745 --> 08:38.065
Why would he still need witnesses?

110
08:38.664 --> 08:39.585
You are right, Master.

111
08:41.625 --> 08:44.305
Sir, I still have a great secret to tell.

112
08:44.985 --> 08:46.385
I snuck into the Study twice.

113
08:46.465 --> 08:47.945
The first time, I didn't find the secret letter,

114
08:48.025 --> 08:50.265
but under the pillow, I found a square handkerchief.

115
08:50.345 --> 08:51.945
Fearing I'd alert him,

116
08:52.025 --> 08:52.865
I didn't dare take it.

117
08:52.945 --> 08:54.785
I stuffed it back, sir.

118
08:55.385 --> 08:59.225
What secret could save your life?

119
09:00.145 --> 09:03.785
How laughable that Lu Zhuo came to pick a fight with me,

120
09:04.665 --> 09:07.145
totally unaware of the crisis brewing at home.

121
09:07.865 --> 09:12.585
Perhaps his fake wife could still be of use to me.

122
09:15.145 --> 09:16.545
XIANZHUANG

123
09:16.625 --> 09:18.265
Maternal Grandmother!

124
09:19.305 --> 09:21.025
Maternal Grandmother!

125
09:21.105 --> 09:24.625
It's me, Rao. Maternal Grandmother!

126
09:25.145 --> 09:26.985
-Do you know whose residence this is? -Grandmother.

127
09:27.065 --> 09:28.225
How dare you cause a disturbance at midnight?

128
09:30.945 --> 09:32.265
HUO JUE, ELDEST SON OF THE HUO FAMILY

129
09:32.345 --> 09:33.425
Rao.

130
09:54.545 --> 09:56.505
If Lu Zhuo knew the wife he married

131
09:56.585 --> 09:59.865
was a filthy, vile, and foul night-soil woman,

132
09:59.945 --> 10:01.585
he would be disgusted to death.

133
10:16.545 --> 10:18.345
Come, drink this ginger soup.

134
10:21.465 --> 10:23.865
Grandmother is cold-hearted and ignores me.

135
10:25.065 --> 10:27.145
Only Maternal Grandmother can stand up for me.

136
10:27.225 --> 10:30.065
Call her here. Call her here!

137
10:30.145 --> 10:31.305
Maternal Grandmother went back to honor our ancestors.

138
10:31.385 --> 10:33.625
My father and mother accompanied her.

139
10:33.705 --> 10:36.465
The round trip will take at least a month.

140
10:39.065 --> 10:41.025
I fear that before she returns,

141
10:41.105 --> 10:43.345
I'll be hounded to death by the evil woman!

142
10:46.465 --> 10:47.305
All of you, dismiss.

143
10:53.665 --> 10:58.625
She stole my place and made the lie reality.

144
10:58.705 --> 11:00.865
I have no way out left.

145
11:01.465 --> 11:03.265
What should I do?

146
11:04.785 --> 11:08.185
I've traveled far and wide for business and dealt with thousands of impostors.

147
11:09.345 --> 11:11.025
No need to disturb Grandmother.

148
11:11.105 --> 11:12.305
Leave everything to me.

149
11:12.385 --> 11:14.505
I will avenge your grievance.

150
11:20.465 --> 11:21.585
Really?

151
11:31.265 --> 11:32.305
Rest assured.

152
11:33.705 --> 11:34.865
First, tell me.

153
11:34.945 --> 11:36.625
What exactly is the woman's background?

154
11:58.305 --> 11:59.785
What's wrong, My Lady?

155
12:03.905 --> 12:05.545
My Lady, what are you…

156
12:05.625 --> 12:07.745
Go to the kitchen and quietly catch a chicken.

157
12:09.505 --> 12:11.265
-Hurry. -Alright.

158
12:26.505 --> 12:28.745
My Lady, what are you doing?

159
12:38.185 --> 12:40.145
The rooster crows thrice as day breaks.

160
12:40.225 --> 12:42.145
The first crow is at the third watch.

161
12:42.225 --> 12:44.465
The third crow is at the fifth watch.

162
12:44.545 --> 12:46.145
There isn't much time left.

163
12:46.225 --> 12:47.465
Before broad daylight,

164
12:47.545 --> 12:51.545
we must find a reliable person to send this bundle to a certain place.

165
12:52.145 --> 12:54.145
My godmother's family is also among the Wei family's dowry servants.

166
12:54.225 --> 12:57.025
My godbrother, Liangcai, grew up on my back

167
12:57.105 --> 12:58.425
and listens to me the most.

168
12:58.505 --> 12:59.905
Rest assured, you can rely on him.

169
13:24.345 --> 13:25.305
Who is it?

170
13:27.385 --> 13:28.665
What's this?

171
13:29.225 --> 13:30.585
How did this end up here?

172
13:30.665 --> 13:32.785
-What is it? -What's in there?

173
13:32.865 --> 13:34.225
-Quick. -What is it?

174
13:41.025 --> 13:43.025
Oh my, it's gold!

175
13:43.105 --> 13:44.145
-Yes, it's gold. -Shh.

176
13:44.225 --> 13:45.625
-Quiet. -It's gold.

177
13:45.705 --> 13:47.225
Keep quiet.

178
13:47.305 --> 13:48.825
Heaven has finally shown mercy

179
13:48.905 --> 13:50.625
-and sent food to us poor folk. -So much gold.

180
13:50.705 --> 13:52.545
There's blood on the wrapping.

181
13:52.625 --> 13:55.865
Some bandit must have stolen treasures from a rich family

182
13:55.945 --> 13:57.825
and thrown this thing in here in panic while being chased.

183
13:58.425 --> 14:00.385
The bandit will surely return for it later,

184
14:00.945 --> 14:03.185
and he'll silence us.

185
14:03.265 --> 14:04.265
-That's right. -We can't take it.

186
14:04.345 --> 14:05.625
Even if the bandit doesn't return,

187
14:05.705 --> 14:08.105
it will still bring legal trouble.

188
14:08.185 --> 14:10.185
We must not do this. We absolutely must not.

189
14:10.265 --> 14:11.425
What should we do?

190
14:12.705 --> 14:15.945
Listen to me. We'll take the gold and scatter

191
14:16.025 --> 14:17.825
so they have no way to trace it back to us.

192
14:21.545 --> 14:23.665
-Don't fight over it. -It's mine.

193
14:23.745 --> 14:25.185
It's mine.

194
14:25.265 --> 14:26.785
Don't fight over it!

195
14:33.145 --> 14:34.305
Search.

196
14:44.585 --> 14:46.425
My Lord, they left in a hurry.

197
14:46.505 --> 14:48.625
They even looted the chicken coop and left nothing behind.

198
14:50.105 --> 14:51.785
We're a step too late. Let's go.

199
15:05.745 --> 15:07.425
Oh no. Why are they back again?

200
15:13.185 --> 15:17.025
I almost forgot about you.

201
15:19.345 --> 15:22.305
What are you doing? I did nothing wrong.

202
15:22.905 --> 15:24.905
Why are you arresting people blindly?

203
15:24.985 --> 15:26.425
Gently. Be gentle.

204
15:27.985 --> 15:30.105
Liangcai said two groups went there.

205
15:30.185 --> 15:32.865
He recognized the first group. They were from the Huo family.

206
15:33.545 --> 15:36.145
Lady Rao's birth mother was the second daughter of the Zhou family.

207
15:36.225 --> 15:39.985
Lady Shou'an also had an eldest daughter who was miswed in her first marriage

208
15:40.065 --> 15:41.985
and remarried into the wealthy Huo family.

209
15:42.065 --> 15:45.145
Huo Jue is the eldest young master of the Huo Residence.

210
15:45.225 --> 15:48.785
So, he is considered Lady Rao's first cousin.

211
15:49.465 --> 15:50.665
What about the other group?

212
15:52.745 --> 15:56.785
Liangcai quietly followed them and found that those people took Madam Liu

213
15:56.865 --> 15:58.545
to the back gate of the Marquis of Xiting's Residence.

214
15:58.625 --> 16:00.465
He asked around through connections

215
16:00.545 --> 16:02.465
and learned that Madam Liu sold fake pearl strings

216
16:02.545 --> 16:04.825
and offended the Old Marquis's favorite concubine.

217
16:04.905 --> 16:06.865
It has nothing to do with you.

218
16:08.065 --> 16:09.425
Marquis of Xiting's Residence…

219
16:11.665 --> 16:14.225
Governess Miao said last night that Lu Zhuo had business to attend to,

220
16:14.825 --> 16:17.265
and Guanzhu said they were catching a spy in the residence.

221
16:17.865 --> 16:19.305
We can't worry about so much now.

222
16:19.385 --> 16:20.865
The banquet is what's important right now.

223
16:20.945 --> 16:21.905
Come.

224
16:26.545 --> 16:29.385
When taking the cup, reaching out too far ruins your grace.

225
16:29.465 --> 16:31.185
Pull back a bit.

226
16:37.065 --> 16:39.425
Lady Rao excels at playing the se and sheng,

227
16:39.505 --> 16:42.705
pity that the Dowager Lady scolded song and dance as frivolous

228
16:42.785 --> 16:44.265
and wouldn't let her indulge in them.

229
16:44.785 --> 16:47.505
In fact, Lady Rao's birth mother back then

230
16:47.585 --> 16:49.625
was also a grace-filled beauty of a dancer.

231
16:50.425 --> 16:51.665
Spy…

232
16:52.745 --> 16:54.465
Marquis of Xiting's Residence…

233
16:56.465 --> 16:57.785
The tenement…

234
17:01.185 --> 17:03.145
Bitao, tell me in detail again

235
17:03.225 --> 17:05.265
about the background of the Marquis of Xiting's Residence

236
17:05.345 --> 17:06.944
and its connection to the Duke's Residence.

237
17:07.545 --> 17:10.224
I heard Han Liao, the heir to the Marquis of Xiting,

238
17:10.944 --> 17:12.865
is Lord Lu's sworn enemy.

239
17:15.625 --> 17:17.265
Madam, His Lordship is here.

240
17:21.065 --> 17:22.345
My Lord.

241
17:23.105 --> 17:24.305
Open the door.

242
17:30.145 --> 17:31.865
I caught a cold from falling into the water last night,

243
17:32.865 --> 17:34.505
and I just took my medicine and lay down.

244
17:34.585 --> 17:35.425
You were frightened after falling into the water.

245
17:35.505 --> 17:37.425
If I ignore it, Grandmother will blame me.

246
17:37.505 --> 17:39.945
I'll leave once I see you're fine. Open the door.

247
17:40.545 --> 17:42.065
I'm too ill and lazy to dress up,

248
17:42.745 --> 17:44.145
and I do not wish to see anyone.

249
17:45.185 --> 17:46.585
Please forgive me, My Lord.

250
17:53.265 --> 17:54.185
Rest well, then.

251
17:54.265 --> 17:57.825
HERITAGE PRESERVED, GOODNESS PROCLAIMED

252
18:02.785 --> 18:04.985
Why didn't you see His Lordship, Young Lady?

253
18:06.025 --> 18:07.705
If I yield to him in everything,

254
18:08.225 --> 18:09.785
he will look down on me even more.

255
18:09.865 --> 18:11.105
Besides,

256
18:11.185 --> 18:13.465
I have more important things to do and can't be bothered with him.

257
18:28.065 --> 18:30.265
"A young girl"…

258
18:31.025 --> 18:32.905
I can't read the last character properly.

259
18:33.825 --> 18:36.465
I never even noticed there were characters here.

260
18:37.585 --> 18:38.665
"A young girl"

261
18:39.985 --> 18:41.985
refers to girls under six chi tall.

262
18:42.985 --> 18:44.705
Most of them started working

263
18:44.785 --> 18:47.465
in public or private workshops from the age of six,

264
18:50.105 --> 18:51.865
quietly carving their names on inconspicuous cup bottoms,

265
18:51.945 --> 18:55.545
foolishly hoping to be like experienced artisans,

266
18:55.625 --> 18:57.585
making a name for themselves to support their families.

267
19:01.105 --> 19:02.865
It was nothing but wishful thinking.

268
19:04.665 --> 19:07.465
How could the nobility ever notice such an insignificant gesture?

269
19:13.785 --> 19:14.665
Bitao,

270
19:16.465 --> 19:17.825
dangers lurk everywhere now,

271
19:19.265 --> 19:20.665
and everyone wants my life.

272
19:21.265 --> 19:22.705
To keep myself safe,

273
19:24.105 --> 19:25.385
I must find a way

274
19:27.385 --> 19:29.465
to make all of the capital know who I am

275
19:32.545 --> 19:34.625
and recognize me alone.

276
19:39.985 --> 19:41.025
What?

277
19:42.065 --> 19:43.945
You want to organize Mother's birthday banquet?

278
19:44.465 --> 19:45.425
That won't do.

279
19:46.345 --> 19:47.545
Why not?

280
19:47.625 --> 19:50.945
This is a gesture of filial piety from my granddaughter-in-law.

281
19:51.025 --> 19:52.625
Why wouldn't it be fine?

282
19:55.025 --> 19:56.345
What she means is,

283
19:57.145 --> 20:00.185
hosting a birthday banquet with many guests, where noble families gather,

284
20:00.265 --> 20:02.425
is not something to be taken lightly.

285
20:03.025 --> 20:03.865
In past years,

286
20:03.945 --> 20:05.865
my sister-in-law and I organized it together,

287
20:05.945 --> 20:08.305
and we barely managed without making a misstep.

288
20:08.825 --> 20:11.425
This year, the Duke specifically sent word

289
20:11.505 --> 20:15.505
that it must be grand, festive, lively, and respectable.

290
20:17.465 --> 20:19.745
Rao has only just married in.

291
20:19.825 --> 20:20.945
She is young and easily overwhelmed.

292
20:21.625 --> 20:23.785
If anything is overlooked or mismanaged,

293
20:24.305 --> 20:25.865
and she fails to hold her ground,

294
20:26.385 --> 20:28.985
and the gossips outside start talking,

295
20:29.065 --> 20:31.105
won't that hurt her sincere filial intentions?

296
20:31.185 --> 20:32.185
Exactly.

297
20:34.545 --> 20:38.425
Rao, you're young and inexperienced.

298
20:38.505 --> 20:40.585
If a birthday celebration like this turns into a laughingstock,

299
20:40.665 --> 20:42.545
it's no child's play.

300
20:44.265 --> 20:45.825
You should gain experience for a couple more years

301
20:45.905 --> 20:47.225
before taking charge.

302
20:48.625 --> 20:50.185
I know you are being considerate of me, Mother,

303
20:50.905 --> 20:53.145
but when the Lu Residence closed its doors before,

304
20:53.225 --> 20:54.905
a lot of groundless gossip started circulating outside.

305
20:55.905 --> 20:57.705
Some say my husband is gravely injured

306
20:58.705 --> 21:00.585
and that the Lu family will decline from now on.

307
21:01.945 --> 21:05.065
Some say that I, the new bride, am hideous and don't dare meet the guests.

308
21:05.145 --> 21:07.265
-This… -And those with ulterior motives

309
21:07.345 --> 21:08.385
fabricated rumors,

310
21:08.945 --> 21:10.345
claiming my husband failed at the front lines

311
21:10.425 --> 21:11.745
and lost His Majesty's favor.

312
21:12.265 --> 21:13.385
All sorts of unbearable rumors…

313
21:13.465 --> 21:15.745
That is precisely why the Duke wants a grand celebration.

314
21:16.905 --> 21:19.145
Is that really true?

315
21:19.225 --> 21:21.025
These rumors have even reached my ears.

316
21:21.625 --> 21:23.465
So I also agree that Rao should step up and make an appearance.

317
21:24.145 --> 21:25.385
Host the birthday according to tradition,

318
21:25.465 --> 21:27.385
with her two sisters-in-law guiding her,

319
21:27.465 --> 21:29.705
and take this opportunity to let her meet the guests

320
21:29.785 --> 21:31.585
to put an end to those outrageous rumors.

321
21:33.825 --> 21:36.265
-But… -What "but"?

322
21:36.345 --> 21:37.865
You are an elder.

323
21:37.945 --> 21:41.825
When asked to guide her, you're still making excuses here.

324
21:41.905 --> 21:43.865
-Mother… -Shut up.

325
21:46.185 --> 21:48.585
Listening to Mother in everything can never go wrong.

326
21:48.665 --> 21:49.825
I…

327
21:50.985 --> 21:53.225
Rao, then

328
21:53.305 --> 21:55.025
we'll do as you say.

329
21:57.145 --> 22:00.345
You really are too impetuous.

330
22:00.425 --> 22:03.705
How could you know the difficulties of organizing a birthday banquet?

331
22:05.025 --> 22:08.065
Back when I first married into the family,

332
22:08.145 --> 22:10.785
I was also naive and arrogant.

333
22:11.305 --> 22:13.785
I suffered so many schemes behind my back.

334
22:14.465 --> 22:17.185
Words can't describe those hardships.

335
22:17.265 --> 22:18.825
Wanniang. Rao.

336
22:18.905 --> 22:19.865
Fourth Aunt.

337
22:21.625 --> 22:23.985
What was the procedure for Grandmother's birthday in previous years?

338
22:24.065 --> 22:26.825
I still need to consult you, Mother and Fourth Aunt.

339
22:26.905 --> 22:28.345
Those are just outdated routines

340
22:28.425 --> 22:29.945
and unwritten traditions.

341
22:30.025 --> 22:31.945
The hard part is bringing new ideas to it.

342
22:33.025 --> 22:34.065
Let's talk as we walk.

343
22:36.785 --> 22:37.825
Come.

344
22:43.905 --> 22:44.985
Come.

345
22:46.865 --> 22:50.985
I thought she was easy to handle, never expecting she would silently

346
22:51.065 --> 22:53.065
steal the spotlight from hosting the banquet.

347
22:53.585 --> 22:56.545
The Wei family produced a vixen long ago.

348
22:56.625 --> 22:58.745
They were never a respectable home.

349
22:58.825 --> 23:00.505
The Dowager Lady just wouldn't listen.

350
23:00.585 --> 23:03.665
Sooner or later, she will stir up trouble and disgrace our family name.

351
23:04.345 --> 23:06.105
Why get angry at a young lady?

352
23:06.625 --> 23:07.545
Her mother-in-law

353
23:07.625 --> 23:09.385
became a laughingstock due to her ignorance.

354
23:09.465 --> 23:11.425
She didn't dare manage the household for years after.

355
23:12.265 --> 23:14.785
Now that she insists on hitting a wall,

356
23:14.865 --> 23:16.465
it's the first branch that loses face.

357
23:16.985 --> 23:18.665
It was unnecessary to stop her.

358
23:20.265 --> 23:21.425
Indeed.

359
23:21.505 --> 23:23.545
From the seating for male and female guests,

360
23:23.625 --> 23:25.865
to the millet for the Dowager Lady's charity porridge,

361
23:26.865 --> 23:28.625
and the taboos of each family in between,

362
23:28.705 --> 23:31.265
which of these can do without you?

363
23:31.345 --> 23:32.945
Her humble mother-in-law

364
23:33.665 --> 23:35.585
is a clear warning.

365
23:35.665 --> 23:36.985
Just watch.

366
23:37.505 --> 23:38.865
Once she makes a huge fool of herself,

367
23:38.945 --> 23:41.305
she will surely come begging you on her knees.

368
23:42.305 --> 23:43.465
Oh, you.

369
23:46.625 --> 23:48.465
Resign to Grandmother immediately.

370
23:48.545 --> 23:51.105
Just say you were young and foolish, accepted recklessly, and now regret it.

371
23:51.665 --> 23:53.865
Having promised an elder, how can I easily back out?

372
23:54.465 --> 23:56.505
You rashly accepted such an important task.

373
23:56.585 --> 23:58.785
If done well, Aunt gets credit for teaching you.

374
23:58.865 --> 23:59.825
If done poorly,

375
23:59.905 --> 24:01.665
it proves you are ignorant and unfit.

376
24:02.585 --> 24:04.505
Under everyone's watchful eyes,

377
24:05.745 --> 24:07.025
you will never recover.

378
24:07.105 --> 24:08.465
Mother was like that because…

379
24:11.465 --> 24:13.825
If you won't go, I will speak for you.

380
24:14.425 --> 24:15.545
Grandmother said

381
24:16.545 --> 24:19.585
that whether it turns out well or not, it shows my filial piety.

382
24:20.265 --> 24:22.505
With Mother and Fourth Aunt guiding me,

383
24:22.585 --> 24:23.705
and you helping me…

384
24:23.785 --> 24:25.145
When did I say I would help you?

385
24:29.185 --> 24:30.825
I belong to the first branch.

386
24:31.745 --> 24:33.785
Any honor or disgrace belongs to the first branch.

387
24:36.025 --> 24:39.585
Could you bear to leave me helpless and make a laughingstock?

388
24:44.985 --> 24:47.945
Please instruct everyone that starting today,

389
24:48.025 --> 24:51.225
all staff in the first branch are at my disposal.

390
24:53.745 --> 24:55.345
You are audacious.

391
24:55.425 --> 24:56.265
And stubborn.

392
24:59.705 --> 25:02.265
My Lord, what is done is done.

393
25:02.985 --> 25:04.105
It cannot be changed.

394
25:15.985 --> 25:17.185
SONGYUE HALL

395
25:17.265 --> 25:18.465
This is the arrangement

396
25:18.545 --> 25:19.905
for the hall and garden on the banquet day.

397
25:19.985 --> 25:21.385
Please review it, Young Lady.

398
25:21.465 --> 25:22.945
Young Lady,

399
25:23.025 --> 25:26.145
the Dowager Lady wants to set up a few extra tables in the garden

400
25:26.225 --> 25:28.585
to invite only close clan members and in-laws.

401
25:28.665 --> 25:32.345
The Zhuo family sent word that Old Madam Zhuo took a fall,

402
25:32.425 --> 25:34.865
has mobility issues, and won't join the bustle.

403
25:34.945 --> 25:38.745
The Ren family apologized, saying Lord Ren will soon take office in Qingzhou.

404
25:39.585 --> 25:42.505
Their household is in chaos, so not everyone can attend.

405
25:42.585 --> 25:45.505
Some relatives complain of the distance and ask for carriages to fetch them.

406
25:45.585 --> 25:48.265
Others are elderly and act too proud to come.

407
25:48.345 --> 25:51.945
The Dowager Lady releases captive animals for her birthday every year.

408
25:52.025 --> 25:55.505
Besides fish and birds, what else should be prepared?

409
25:55.585 --> 25:59.505
-It's urgent. How can we not be anxious? -We are so worried.

410
25:59.585 --> 26:00.705
What should we do?

411
26:00.785 --> 26:02.665
-How could we not worry? -Indeed.

412
26:02.745 --> 26:04.945
-What do we do now? -What now?

413
26:07.625 --> 26:10.465
The region producing the Duke's favorite Qiulubai liquor suffered a disaster.

414
26:10.545 --> 26:11.825
We can have Lansheng, Zihong or Huaying liquors,

415
26:11.905 --> 26:12.825
which one should substitute for it?

416
26:12.905 --> 26:14.985
Aunt, Rao invited you repeatedly.

417
26:15.585 --> 26:17.305
She must want to show off her abilities.

418
26:17.385 --> 26:18.745
You should go in and take a look.

419
26:19.905 --> 26:20.865
First Madam has arrived.

420
26:20.945 --> 26:21.945
Let me talk first!

421
26:30.345 --> 26:31.265
Mother,

422
26:32.865 --> 26:34.465
I have been waiting for you.

423
26:41.865 --> 26:44.625
Rao, we came to watch you manage the household.

424
26:45.225 --> 26:48.265
Aunt has never been used to scenes like this.

425
26:49.225 --> 26:51.065
It is better not to make her feel uneasy.

426
26:51.825 --> 26:54.465
Mother, I only married into the Duke's Residence a few days ago.

427
26:54.545 --> 26:55.425
How much experience could I have?

428
26:56.905 --> 26:59.225
I rely on you to decide for me.

429
26:59.305 --> 27:01.985
By sitting here, you give me your full support.

430
27:04.545 --> 27:06.505
Make a list of the furnishings in the hall

431
27:07.025 --> 27:09.065
and check it with Miss Qingtong in the Dowager Lady's courtyard.

432
27:09.145 --> 27:11.385
Ask her directly about anything to add, remove, or avoid.

433
27:11.465 --> 27:13.465
-Just ask her. -Yes.

434
27:13.545 --> 27:17.185
The Zhuo and Ren families are in-laws, so as a junior, I cannot make decisions.

435
27:17.265 --> 27:18.105
Tomorrow, at the Third Quarter of the Hour of Mao,

436
27:18.185 --> 27:19.985
I will go to Wanxiang Hall

437
27:20.065 --> 27:21.545
and report the replies from both families to the Dowager Lady

438
27:21.625 --> 27:23.865
in front of my two aunts.

439
27:23.945 --> 27:26.225
List any other relatives or in-laws who are not coming,

440
27:26.305 --> 27:28.505
and I will report them to her together.

441
27:28.585 --> 27:29.745
There is no need to trouble yourselves.

442
27:30.705 --> 27:31.625
Yes.

443
27:31.705 --> 27:35.385
As for spending money, tailoring clothes,

444
27:35.465 --> 27:37.265
raising birds, feeding fish,

445
27:37.345 --> 27:39.905
managing garden plants, and handling food and drinks,

446
27:42.505 --> 27:45.705
I thought you were all experienced with your tasks

447
27:46.305 --> 27:48.705
and would keep everything organized without mistakes.

448
27:49.705 --> 27:51.745
I even planned to pick two capable ones

449
27:51.825 --> 27:54.905
and report to the Dowager Lady to promote them to head stewardesses.

450
27:55.505 --> 27:56.585
I did not expect

451
27:57.145 --> 27:58.825
you all to be so incompetent.

452
27:59.345 --> 28:01.865
Even the tiniest tasks were brought to the one in charge.

453
28:02.385 --> 28:05.425
Either it was ill intent or it was sheer incapacity.

454
28:05.505 --> 28:07.945
If I used my overbearing temper from home,

455
28:08.025 --> 28:10.345
I would dismiss you without asking questions.

456
28:13.025 --> 28:16.625
However, I have not been here long,

457
28:17.145 --> 28:19.105
so I do not know your character well yet.

458
28:20.025 --> 28:23.025
I do not know who to replace or who to promote.

459
28:23.105 --> 28:25.425
So, please decide, Mother.

460
28:26.425 --> 28:27.625
Me?

461
28:28.185 --> 28:29.025
Governess Miao.

462
28:29.865 --> 28:31.225
Do not worry, Madam.

463
28:31.745 --> 28:34.385
My family has served in this residence for three generations.

464
28:34.465 --> 28:37.665
I know characters and abilities of the servants the best.

465
28:37.745 --> 28:40.185
Whether loyal or treacherous, honest or slick,

466
28:40.265 --> 28:42.545
no one can hide from my eyes.

467
28:44.105 --> 28:47.185
Aunt, aren't you most afraid of scenes like this?

468
28:47.265 --> 28:48.865
Why don't we…

469
28:48.945 --> 28:50.665
You are the mother of the heir

470
28:51.265 --> 28:54.065
and the proper First Madam of the Duke's Residence.

471
28:54.145 --> 28:56.105
Just sit here and take charge.

472
28:56.185 --> 28:57.385
Governess Miao will assign the tasks.

473
28:58.505 --> 28:59.945
If anyone dares to delay their work,

474
29:00.545 --> 29:02.985
feign compliance, or deliberately cause trouble,

475
29:04.225 --> 29:06.105
just have Zhao Song drag them out for a flogging.

476
29:06.985 --> 29:10.745
Lord Lu said he cannot manage a household, but he can lead an army.

477
29:11.265 --> 29:14.265
After twenty military flogging strikes tear their flesh open,

478
29:14.345 --> 29:16.145
every single one of them will obey.

479
29:16.225 --> 29:19.385
-Well… -Goodness…

480
29:20.585 --> 29:22.065
Then, I will give it a try.

481
29:23.985 --> 29:27.105
Aunt, since my cousin has spoken,

482
29:27.785 --> 29:30.065
I will stay and help too.

483
29:32.785 --> 29:34.825
Zhao Song, stay to assist.

484
29:35.745 --> 29:38.145
Zhao Bai, follow me. I have important orders.

485
29:39.385 --> 29:40.665
-Yes. -Yes.

486
29:55.785 --> 29:57.505
Bring them all forward.

487
29:59.425 --> 30:00.985
One by one.

488
30:08.025 --> 30:09.065
Over here.

489
30:11.345 --> 30:12.465
Is that it?

490
30:12.545 --> 30:13.665
How many did you catch?

491
30:14.545 --> 30:16.025
I've got more.

492
30:16.105 --> 30:16.945
Over there.

493
30:18.145 --> 30:19.225
Don't let it get away.

494
30:21.945 --> 30:22.985
Gently.

495
30:24.465 --> 30:25.465
I caught it.

496
30:27.305 --> 30:29.705
After Lady Wei Rao fell into the water, I sent people repeatedly to inquire.

497
30:29.785 --> 30:31.345
Why didn't you reply to me?

498
30:31.425 --> 30:33.145
That night, the city guards searched the market,

499
30:33.225 --> 30:34.505
finding no major robbers or villains,

500
30:34.585 --> 30:36.385
though they did catch a few petty thieves.

501
30:37.385 --> 30:40.505
Did you confirm with Lady Wei Rao?

502
30:41.825 --> 30:43.305
What "Lady Wei Rao"?

503
30:43.825 --> 30:45.585
By etiquette, you should call her sister-in-law.

504
30:48.785 --> 30:50.705
Be gentle. They're all flying away.

505
30:55.465 --> 30:57.465
Right now, you should be busy with the Dowager Lady's birthday banquet.

506
30:57.545 --> 31:00.145
Yet you have time to catch butterflies here.

507
31:00.745 --> 31:02.865
It was my fault to suspect you without cause earlier.

508
31:03.385 --> 31:04.945
I hope you can forgive me, Lady Wei Rao.

509
31:05.825 --> 31:07.945
General Qi, your mistakes are more than just one.

510
31:08.545 --> 31:09.985
You scared away my butterfly.

511
31:15.945 --> 31:17.065
You got it?

512
31:19.585 --> 31:20.745
Thank you, My Lord.

513
31:23.585 --> 31:24.585
What are you doing?

514
31:25.305 --> 31:28.305
I specially caught some butterflies to release at the birthday hall,

515
31:29.385 --> 31:31.225
letting them flutter around the lamps and rest on flowers.

516
31:31.825 --> 31:34.705
We'll also prepare sweet melons for them to perch on,

517
31:34.785 --> 31:39.225
wishing for a long line of descendants and good fortune year after year.

518
31:39.305 --> 31:41.585
Lady Wei Rao, you really know how to please people.

519
31:41.665 --> 31:43.465
When the time comes, with flowers filling the hall and butterflies fluttering,

520
31:43.545 --> 31:44.745
the Dowager Lady will be overjoyed.

521
31:46.025 --> 31:48.705
Trying to steal the show at an elder's birthday defeats the main purpose.

522
31:49.305 --> 31:50.425
It's better to focus on the practical work.

523
31:51.105 --> 31:52.945
The garden is full of maids.

524
31:53.025 --> 31:55.465
My Lord, do you only see me?

525
31:58.185 --> 31:59.585
When everyone wears flowers in their hair,

526
32:00.265 --> 32:02.945
a display of blooms is nothing special.

527
32:03.985 --> 32:08.905
Instead, the one dressed most plainly stands out the most among the women.

528
32:09.625 --> 32:11.705
Following the same old routine for the birthday banquet,

529
32:12.305 --> 32:14.065
no matter how proper the details are,

530
32:14.145 --> 32:15.585
it's just mediocre and error-free.

531
32:15.665 --> 32:18.505
If you want to win full applause and make guests feel at home,

532
32:18.585 --> 32:20.065
you need a little clever ingenuity

533
32:20.665 --> 32:22.385
and add more lively topics.

534
32:22.985 --> 32:24.545
Why don't you help me catch a couple, My Lord?

535
32:26.785 --> 32:27.825
Catch them yourself.

536
32:28.385 --> 32:29.265
I don't have time for this.

537
32:30.025 --> 32:31.785
To show my apologies, I'll help you.

538
32:33.025 --> 32:34.825
-You don't have time either. -I do.

539
32:34.905 --> 32:36.185
-Jiede. -Don't…

540
32:36.265 --> 32:37.345
-Send more servants to help. -I'm free.

541
32:37.425 --> 32:40.225
-Yes. -I really am free. Slow down.

542
32:40.305 --> 32:41.825
-So rough. -Farewell, My Lord.

543
32:41.905 --> 32:43.145
Ouch, that hurts.

544
32:51.345 --> 32:54.185
Catch them quickly. A generous reward for whoever catches the most.

545
32:54.265 --> 32:55.785
-Yes. -Yes.

546
32:59.865 --> 33:01.985
Mother, when I arrived,

547
33:02.065 --> 33:03.745
I saw my second brother at the martial grounds.

548
33:03.825 --> 33:06.945
Over a dozen guards were beaten to pieces by him.

549
33:07.025 --> 33:09.225
He will surely be a fierce general in the future.

550
33:09.305 --> 33:11.505
I see Grandfather values him more and more,

551
33:11.585 --> 33:13.745
even choosing a new martial arts master for him.

552
33:13.825 --> 33:16.705
Though he says he treats everyone equally

553
33:16.785 --> 33:18.865
and loves every grandson just the same,

554
33:19.585 --> 33:22.265
deep down in his heart,

555
33:22.345 --> 33:23.465
it's crystal clear

556
33:23.545 --> 33:27.585
that only the eldest grandson of the first branch is his favorite.

557
33:27.665 --> 33:30.185
The rest are just afterthought extras.

558
33:35.745 --> 33:36.705
Mother, don't.

559
33:37.265 --> 33:39.705
If you make this move, you will lose.

560
33:39.785 --> 33:41.545
Quiet while watching a game.

561
33:43.785 --> 33:44.865
Second Madam,

562
33:44.945 --> 33:46.265
Her Ladyship is leading people from the first branch

563
33:46.345 --> 33:47.665
to catch butterflies everywhere,

564
33:47.745 --> 33:49.025
saying it's for the Dowager Lady's birthday.

565
33:50.585 --> 33:52.665
What an assertive Heir's Wife.

566
33:52.745 --> 33:56.625
She acts so wildly and recklessly.

567
33:56.705 --> 33:59.265
Who knows what scheme she is plotting behind our backs?

568
33:59.345 --> 34:01.465
Mother, don't let her get too complacent.

569
34:01.545 --> 34:03.865
She's too young after all.

570
34:03.945 --> 34:06.385
She's just eager to establish authority and claim credit.

571
34:07.625 --> 34:09.025
What's your hurry?

572
34:09.625 --> 34:11.625
The rafter that sticks out rots first.

573
34:11.705 --> 34:12.905
Sooner or later, she will learn her lesson.

574
34:21.665 --> 34:23.505
My Lady, you even know how to do this?

575
34:24.545 --> 34:26.545
I learned it all in the workshops in the past.

576
34:27.145 --> 34:29.185
Things I used to hate deeply.

577
34:32.425 --> 34:33.585
You wouldn't know

578
34:34.344 --> 34:37.025
I entered the lacquer workshop as a hard laborer at five.

579
34:38.585 --> 34:40.385
My whole body was covered in sores from the raw lacquer fumes.

580
34:40.465 --> 34:41.465
YOUNG A-CHOU

581
34:43.545 --> 34:45.185
At ten, I disguised as a boy up in the hills to make charcoal.

582
34:45.264 --> 34:46.105
Hurry up.

583
34:46.185 --> 34:48.625
-A landslide almost killed me. -Don't dawdle.

584
34:48.705 --> 34:49.865
Hurry!

585
34:50.744 --> 34:54.065
Keep up! Hurry up!

586
34:54.905 --> 34:55.784
Get up.

587
34:57.865 --> 34:59.025
Hurry up.

588
34:59.625 --> 35:01.345
When the suffering became unbearable,

589
35:02.265 --> 35:03.665
I often dreamed

590
35:04.345 --> 35:07.225
that my real parents were rich,

591
35:08.505 --> 35:09.945
and that one day,

592
35:11.025 --> 35:12.745
they would rescue me from the abyss.

593
35:16.745 --> 35:17.745
Isn't it ridiculous?

594
35:20.465 --> 35:24.345
I often fantasized that if I ever went back one day,

595
35:24.425 --> 35:28.585
how I would win my elders' favor and make a name for myself.

596
35:30.945 --> 35:32.425
Only later did I realize

597
35:35.505 --> 35:37.305
that no one was coming.

598
35:38.425 --> 35:41.665
My pa was just a rogue gambler.

599
35:42.745 --> 35:44.585
My ma had tuberculosis.

600
35:44.665 --> 35:45.785
And I

601
35:46.825 --> 35:48.625
was born in the mire.

602
35:49.345 --> 35:50.665
If I didn't fight with all my strength,

603
35:53.625 --> 35:55.185
I will only sink further,

604
35:56.985 --> 35:58.265
down to the very depths.

605
36:26.785 --> 36:28.305
Moths are not butterflies.

606
36:28.825 --> 36:30.425
They have no pretty patterns.

607
36:31.025 --> 36:34.305
Yet their antennae are like rigid riding whips.

608
36:35.785 --> 36:37.625
They are born to travel far.

609
36:38.225 --> 36:39.425
Indeed.

610
36:42.145 --> 36:43.465
At this gambling table,

611
36:45.145 --> 36:47.305
others have wealth and family to help them.

612
36:47.905 --> 36:49.665
I only have myself.

613
36:50.305 --> 36:52.025
So I will stake my life on it,

614
36:54.025 --> 36:55.945
to see if I end up empty-handed

615
36:57.665 --> 36:59.745
or clean out the board.

616
37:01.065 --> 37:02.425
Invite Lord Lu for me.

617
37:03.585 --> 37:05.345
My Lady, are you planning to…

618
37:07.385 --> 37:08.585
Pardon my asking,

619
37:08.665 --> 37:10.465
but Lord Lu is the very model of propriety,

620
37:10.545 --> 37:12.065
following old rules in everything.

621
37:12.665 --> 37:16.025
Guanzhu said his routine and diet haven't changed for years.

622
37:16.105 --> 37:17.785
If even one new dish is added, he has it sent back.

623
37:18.945 --> 37:22.225
He usually despises novel or frivolous tricks.

624
37:22.305 --> 37:23.465
I doubt he'll agree.

625
37:23.545 --> 37:25.305
You make a good point.

626
37:26.465 --> 37:28.185
I should think of a way

627
37:29.985 --> 37:31.945
to leave him no choice but to agree.

628
37:55.705 --> 37:56.745
My Lord.

629
38:27.665 --> 38:29.145
Sorry for keeping you waiting, My Lord.

630
38:32.105 --> 38:33.705
Stop once you've caught the butterflies.

631
38:34.225 --> 38:36.545
Disregarding convention for novelty

632
38:37.505 --> 38:38.585
will lead to trouble sooner or later.

633
38:39.305 --> 38:42.745
I invited you here because I heard Miss Qingtong say

634
38:42.825 --> 38:44.345
the Dowager Lady often suffers from night terrors

635
38:44.425 --> 38:45.265
and struggles to sleep soundly.

636
38:45.345 --> 38:47.025
I am aware of that.

637
38:47.545 --> 38:50.025
After consultation, the physicians said it wasn't an illness,

638
38:51.225 --> 38:52.745
just that as people age,

639
38:52.825 --> 38:54.905
they sleep lightly and wake easily at night.

640
38:56.225 --> 38:58.865
I have something that can help her sleep well,

641
38:59.865 --> 39:01.065
but I need your help, My Lord.

642
39:02.465 --> 39:03.585
What can you do?

643
39:06.305 --> 39:07.345
This way, please.

644
39:10.705 --> 39:12.065
No foolishness.

645
39:12.145 --> 39:13.345
I mean no offense.

646
39:14.265 --> 39:16.265
You'll understand once you take a look, My Lord.

647
39:39.785 --> 39:40.665
It's drawing paper.

648
39:42.145 --> 39:45.265
Look, add a top cover above,

649
39:45.345 --> 39:47.465
and sew the four sides with fishing line.

650
39:47.545 --> 39:48.625
That makes a paper canopy.

651
39:49.465 --> 39:52.625
I thought of hanging lotus wall vases at the four corners,

652
39:52.705 --> 39:54.545
accompanied by moonlight and lotus fragrance,

653
39:54.625 --> 39:56.705
as if walking deep in a lotus pond.

654
39:57.465 --> 39:58.785
Then, I thought

655
39:59.745 --> 40:02.745
this paper canopy was too plain and bleak.

656
40:03.425 --> 40:05.905
Though real flowers are lovely, they don't bloom long,

657
40:06.425 --> 40:07.825
which might only make an elder feel sad.

658
40:08.825 --> 40:10.545
It would be better to paint them on.

659
40:11.225 --> 40:14.105
Actually, I preferred a silk canopy.

660
40:14.625 --> 40:18.385
On the sides, embroidering scriptures in seal script shows sincerity.

661
40:19.465 --> 40:21.585
But my embroidery skills are poor.

662
40:21.665 --> 40:24.465
I can only embroider two or three characters a day.

663
40:24.545 --> 40:25.865
I couldn't make it in time for the banquet.

664
40:29.385 --> 40:31.865
The Dowager Lady loves your paintings of flowers and birds,

665
40:33.065 --> 40:34.945
so I asked for your help.

666
41:53.345 --> 41:56.305
Lotuses are fine flowers, but they are just like you,

667
41:56.385 --> 41:57.345
chillingly cold,

668
41:58.785 --> 42:00.185
lacking a touch of vitality.

669
42:00.945 --> 42:03.985
The decorations in Wanxiang Hall are uniquely crafted,

670
42:04.785 --> 42:07.545
showing the Dowager Lady's love for nature.

671
42:09.545 --> 42:11.025
In my view…

672
42:24.985 --> 42:27.825
A few strokes on the grass leaves pictures a grasshopper.

673
42:30.145 --> 42:31.665
Dragonflies are dancing.

674
42:33.665 --> 42:35.105
That's a sign of vitality.

675
43:07.945 --> 43:08.785
Wei Rao,

676
43:09.785 --> 43:11.265
don't forget our agreement.

677
43:14.585 --> 43:15.785
I really regret

678
43:17.865 --> 43:19.545
making that one-year pact.

679
43:23.465 --> 43:24.945
I want to be

680
43:28.265 --> 43:30.945
a true wife to you in every sense.

681
43:47.505 --> 43:48.345
In your dreams.

682
43:49.385 --> 43:50.385
Careful.

683
43:51.465 --> 43:52.905
Don't ruin my paper canopy.

684
43:54.105 --> 43:55.945
Even if you use filial piety to pressure me,

685
43:56.545 --> 43:58.585
I will never take a scheming woman as my wife.

686
44:01.025 --> 44:02.665
If you haven't tried,

687
44:07.025 --> 44:08.505
how do you know it's no good?

688
44:44.665 --> 44:46.545
What did you put in the incense burner?

689
44:48.385 --> 44:50.345
Just a little mood enhancer

690
44:55.265 --> 44:56.865
to add fragrance to the room.

691
44:58.425 --> 44:59.745
Do you like it?

692
45:14.785 --> 45:17.385
If you suspect I drugged it, check it yourself.

693
45:18.185 --> 45:21.385
For a bit of calming incense, you ruined my birthday gift.

694
45:23.505 --> 45:24.745
It's just a paper canopy.

695
45:25.825 --> 45:27.105
We can just make another one.

696
45:27.625 --> 45:30.025
All the large paper in the storehouse is here.

697
45:30.105 --> 45:32.425
Where do we find more on short notice?

698
45:33.625 --> 45:34.785
It is you who tease me so.

699
45:37.465 --> 45:39.305
To match this bed-curtain,

700
45:40.225 --> 45:42.385
I gathered bulrush fluff everywhere for the mattress,

701
45:43.065 --> 45:46.225
steamed and dried it, working day and night,

702
45:46.305 --> 45:49.585
and even coughed for two nights from the floating fluff.

703
45:49.665 --> 45:51.945
Now the bed-curtain is gone, all for nothing.

704
45:53.145 --> 45:54.865
I am an decent girl of unsullied reputation.

705
45:55.985 --> 45:58.225
If the Dowager Lady hadn't begged me,

706
45:58.785 --> 46:01.905
hoping we'd make peace, and sent servants to check in,

707
46:02.705 --> 46:07.105
why would I force myself on you and get called shameless?

708
46:08.905 --> 46:11.825
We can find another birthday gift, but promises must be kept.

709
46:12.985 --> 46:14.825
We agreed to be a couple for just one year,

710
46:14.905 --> 46:16.225
and that won't change.

711
46:16.985 --> 46:18.585
Don't get your hopes up.

712
46:19.665 --> 46:20.745
Tonight, if it's Grandmother's wish…

713
46:23.745 --> 46:25.145
I won't blame you.

714
46:32.185 --> 46:33.265
Didn't you prepare other things?

715
46:34.025 --> 46:35.225
I'll have people make them for you.

716
46:39.985 --> 46:41.185
Ordinary craftsmen can't do it.

717
46:41.265 --> 46:43.145
I'll get the best palace artisans to make them.

718
46:43.225 --> 46:45.025
I'm afraid it will cost too much,

719
46:45.665 --> 46:47.305
cause a stir, attract attention,

720
46:47.385 --> 46:49.385
and go against your principles.

721
46:50.865 --> 46:53.305
Before Grandmother's birthday, I'll have them done and delivered.

722
47:17.225 --> 47:18.385
My Lord.

723
47:24.585 --> 47:27.705
‎LAMP BLUEPRINT

724
47:28.945 --> 47:32.465
So after all that effort, this was your goal all along.

725
47:44.465 --> 47:47.025
Find the best craftsmen and have it finished before the birthday.

726
47:48.665 --> 47:50.465
Delay by a single day, and you will answer for it.

727
47:54.985 --> 47:56.225
What are you laughing at?

728
48:13.865 --> 48:15.025
Get out.

729
51:11.585 --> 51:13.985
‎NO ANIMALS WERE HARMED ‎IN THE MAKING OF THIS SHOW
